            Explore the comprehensive science behind lubrication regimes, base oils, and global additive developments.
          </li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
            <a href="/lubricant-base-oil-types-explained" target="_top" style="font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Base Oil Types Explained (Group I-V)</a><br>
            A technical guide to API base oil classifications, comparing mineral-based and high-performance synthetic PAOs and Esters.
          </li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
            <a href="/additives-in-lubricants-guide" target="_top" style="font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Additive Packages in Lubricants</a><br>
            Understand boundary layer kinetics, friction modifiers, detergent-dispersants, and zinc dialkyldithiophosphate (ZDDP) behavior.
          </li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
            <a href="/car-engine-oil-vs-motorcycle-engine-oils" target="_top" style="font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Car Engine Oil vs. Motorcycle Engine Oils</a><br>
