          </li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
            <a href="/manufacturing-without-a-factory-guide" target="_top" style="font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Contract Manufacturing &amp; Toll Blending Guide</a><br>
            How chemical startups can launch and scale proprietary formulas using toll blending and asset-light production models.
          </li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
            <a href="/msds-tds-coa-guide" target="_top" style="font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Guide to Chemical Documentation</a><br>
            Understanding MSDS, TDS, and COA documents is non-negotiable for compliance, exports, and institutional supply chains.
          </li>
